Z||000000||Lou Christopher||09-27-2001||03:02 PM||||I wanted to update those of you who wrote to me and were interested in my radiator research/purchase.  I got the radiator three weeks ago but a small stroke efficting my left eye etc. has slowed me down a bit.  Anyway I have attached pictures of the radiator before and after installation and one of the trans cooler installation.  I am modifying some other engine plumbing so I have not test driven it yet.  Will make one last post on the results as soon as possible but I am a little slow right now.  If you want any detals please ask.<BR>                   Lou<P>Ps.  I tried to attach the pictures but the only way I could find to do it was if I had a URL address.  If you are interested contact me and I will attach them to an Email to you.<P>           <P>------------------<BR>||||reg||1
