Z||000004||Nashco||09-27-2001||11:11 PM||||I would be <B>VERY</B> interested in knowing the weight of the new aluminum radiator, and the weight of the old radiator.  Did you happen to weight it?  If not, how far in is it...would you be able to remove it?  If not, no biggie, but that would be some great information on weight savings.  I figure it should be good for at least 5 pounds..??<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
